title: Welcome & Approach Detection Lighting
raw_community_title: Enable Approach/Welcome Lighting on 2025 Job 2 Flash
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2024-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro & Lightning Community
source_sheet: F-150 Lightning FORScan Thread
notes: Enables approach and welcome lighting sequence on 2025 Job 2 Flash.
